   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1  A stocktake report on the existing social protection landscape and institutional arrangement to identify capacities gaps  and opportunities
1.2 Number of government entities engaged in the formulation of DPSN
1.3 Number of vulnerable communities engaged in the development of the DPSN disaggregated by gender, age, ethnicity and disabilities 
1.4 A gender responsive National Social Protection Policy  developed and adopted by the government
1.5 A monitoring and evaluation handbook for the DPSN developed with relevant agencies trained on monitoring &amp; evaluation

2.1 An assessment of the gaps in current social registry (including gender gaps), and recommendations for improvement
2.2 An enhanced Social Protection Database architecture and Action Plan developed
2.3 Number of vulnerable communities participated in the pilot roll-out of the enhanced Social Protection site disaggregated by age, gender, ethnicity, disabilities
2.4 A consolidated report on user feedback to the Social Protection pilot site

3.1 Number of government officers trained on the new DPSN
3.2 Number of government staffs sensitized on gender mainstreaming in the context of social protection/ assistance
3.3 Number of vulnerable communities engaged, awareness raised on the use of the new DPSN, disaggregated by sex, age, ethnicity and disability
3.4 Number of South-South exchange held on Social Protection Registry Best Practice with regional governments</narrative>
    </description>
